---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_COPY } from '../../../data/site-copy';
import release from '../../../data/release.json';

const copy = SITE_COPY.en;
---
<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title={copy.docsTitle}
  description={copy.docsDescription}
  canonicalPath="/en/docs/"
  altPath="/docs/"
>
  <section class="section" style="border-top: 0; padding-top: 48px;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 820px;">
      <h1 class="section-title" style="font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);">
        NexaDock Installation &amp; Operations Guide
      </h1>
      <p class="section-desc" style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        Current published build: <strong>{release.tag}</strong> (Unsigned Development Pre-release).
      </p>

      <div class="mechanism-list">
        <div class="mechanism-row">
          <h3>1. Windows Installation</h3>
          <p>
            Download <span class="code-inline">NexaDock-{release.version}-windows-x64-setup.exe</span> or <span class="code-inline">.msi</span> and verify its SHA-256 hash against <span class="code-inline">SHA256SUMS.txt</span>. On Smart App Control (<span class="code-inline">SAC=1</span>) machines, keep SAC enabled and run via the signed host bridge: <span class="code-inline">node apps/desktop/ui-server.mjs</span>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mechanism-row">
          <h3>2. Upgrading from KHOANG</h3>
          <p>
            NexaDock preserves <span class="code-inline">com.multizalodesktop.manager</span>, <span class="code-inline">%LOCALAPPDATA%\MultiZaloDesktop</span>, and <span class="code-inline">khoang-preferences.json</span>. Existing accounts, backups, and WebIsolated profiles remain intact.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mechanism-row">
          <h3>3. Diagnostics &amp; Recovery</h3>
          <p>
            Use the built-in Diagnostics screen to inspect client discovery, isolation checks, and sanitized logs. Guards such as <span class="code-inline">PROTECTED_PRIMARY_PROCESS</span> confirm that primary Zalo protection is active.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
